---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const criteria = [
  { title: 'Back and lay experience', detail: 'Explain the difference with a checked, dated example and make the potential lay liability clear.' },
  { title: 'Market depth and liquidity', detail: 'Evaluate whether useful prices and matched amounts were available in the events actually tested.' },
  { title: 'Commission and charges', detail: 'Use the operator’s current charge schedule, checked for the reader’s market and account status.' },
  { title: 'Payments and support', detail: 'Record a real test date, method, outcome and any limitations rather than generic claims.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Betfair Exchange review — exchange variant pilot" sidebar={true} relatedTopic="football">
  <article class="exchange-review">
    <nav class="exchange-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/pilot/home/">EveryTip</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span>Exchange reviews</span></nav>
    <header class="exchange-hero"><div><p class="kicker">Independent exchange review · design pilot</p><h1>Betfair Exchange review</h1><p class="exchange-deck">A review structure for an exchange, where matched bets, lay liability, market depth and commission matter more than a bookmaker welcome-bonus scorecard.</p><div class="exchange-meta"><span>By JP, Chief Editor</span><span>1 October 2026 template snapshot</span><span>Claims need a current test</span></div></div><aside class="exchange-verdict"><span>Our view</span><strong>Verdict pending re-test</strong><p>The live page contains an older numeric rating and promotional terms. Neither is carried into this preview as a current recommendation.</p></aside></header>
    <div class="exchange-alert"><strong>Source review needs a new editorial check</strong><p>The existing exchange article includes changing details about commission, offer eligibility, product features and performance. Confirm those with first-hand testing and official operator sources before launch. No commercial CTA is active here.</p></div>
    <nav class="exchange-jump" aria-label="On this review"><a href="#exchange-fit">Who it suits</a><a href="#exchange-how">How it works</a><a href="#exchange-criteria">Review criteria</a><a href="#exchange-testing">Testing notes</a><a href="#exchange-offer">Optional offer</a></nav>
    <section id="exchange-fit" class="exchange-section"><p class="kicker">The quick read</p><h2>Who might an exchange suit?</h2><div class="exchange-fit-grid"><div><h3>Potential fit</h3><p>Readers who want to understand matching, pricing and the option to lay a selection. The final review should say what was actually tested and where an exchange was useful.</p></div><div><h3>What to weigh up</h3><p>Unmatched bets, lay liability and commission can make the experience less straightforward. Explain each risk before any sign-up prompt.</p></div></div></section>
    <section id="exchange-how" class="exchange-section"><p class="kicker">Exchange basics</p><h2>Back, lay and matched bets</h2><p>Preserve the useful explanatory substance from the live review, but edit it as ordinary WordPress body content. A reusable definition block can explain back and lay betting, followed by an editor-approved worked example.</p><div class="exchange-process"><div><strong>01</strong><span>Choose a market and price</span></div><div><strong>02</strong><span>See whether another party matches the bet</span></div><div><strong>03</strong><span>Understand stake, liability and charges</span></div></div><p class="exchange-caption">Illustrative process only; not a betting instruction or a guarantee of matching.</p></section>
    <section id="exchange-criteria" class="exchange-section"><p class="kicker">Review framework</p><h2>What we would test</h2><div class="exchange-criteria">{criteria.map((item, index) => <article><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><div><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.detail}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section id="exchange-testing" class="exchange-section"><p class="kicker">Evidence before score</p><h2>How this review should be maintained</h2><p>WordPress should store the reviewer, test date, markets sampled, devices used, evidence links and editorial verdict. A numeric rating is optional and should be published only when the criteria and date behind it are recorded. This is intentionally different from the Bet365 bookmaker review.</p><div class="exchange-evidence"><span>Reviewer</span><strong>Editorial field</strong><span>Test date</span><strong>Required before launch</strong><span>Commission source</span><strong>Official schedule link</strong><span>Offer record</span><strong>Optional ACF relation</strong></div></section>
    <aside id="exchange-offer" class="exchange-offer"><div><p class="kicker">Separate commercial record</p><h2>Any current offer belongs to ACF</h2><p>If a current, eligible exchange offer exists, its headline, audience, compact terms and full terms come from one approved ACF record. This review supplies the independent analysis, not duplicate promotion copy.</p></div><div class="exchange-offer-placeholder"><strong>No active offer in preview</strong><span>Affiliate link disabled</span></div></aside>
    <footer class="exchange-footer">Affiliate disclosure: EveryTip may earn a commission from eligible registrations, but the review must retain independently tested strengths and criticisms. 18+ · Gamble responsibly.</footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .exchange-review{color:#263b4d}.exchange-crumb{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:17px;color:#6c7c88;font-size:12px}.exchange-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 210px;gap:22px;padding:25px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#e9f2f9,#fff);border-top:5px solid var(--et-orange)}.exchange-hero h1{margin:3px 0 9px}.exchange-deck{max-width:630px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5}.exchange-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:15px}.exchange-meta span{padding:6px 9px;background:#fff;color:#526d80;font-size:11px;font-weight:750}.exchange-verdict{display:grid;align-content:center;gap:8px;padding:16px;background:#fff;border-top:4px solid var(--et-blue)}.exchange-verdict>span{font-size:11px;color:#a75000;font-weight:850;text-transform:uppercase}.exchange-verdict strong{color:#174c75;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2}.exchange-verdict p{margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.exchange-alert{margin:15px 0;padding:14px;background:#fff4e8;border-left:4px solid var(--et-orange);font-size:12px}.exchange-alert p{margin:5px 0 0}.exchange-jump{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:9px 0 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce6ec}.exchange-jump a{padding:7px 10px;background:#eaf3f9;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;font-size:12px}.exchange-section{margin-top:31px;scroll-margin-top:20px}.exchange-section h2{margin:3px 0 10px}.exchange-section>p:not(.kicker){max-width:760px;line-height:1.6}.exchange-fit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:11px}.exchange-fit-grid>div{padding:17px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce7ee;border-top:4px solid var(--et-blue)}.exchange-fit-grid>div:last-child{border-top-color:var(--et-orange)}.exchange-fit-grid h3{margin:0 0 7px}.exchange-fit-grid p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}.exchange-process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px;margin-top:18px}.exchange-process div{display:grid;gap:6px;padding:15px;background:#eaf3f9;font-size:13px}.exchange-process strong{color:#a84e00;font-size:19px}.exchange-caption{font-size:11px;color:#607888}.exchange-criteria{display:grid;gap:9px}.exchange-criteria article{display:flex;gap:13px;padding:15px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce7ee}.exchange-criteria article>span{font-weight:850;color:#b45700}.exchange-criteria h3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:16px}.exchange-criteria p{margin:0;color:#526c7f;font-size:13px}.exchange-evidence{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;gap:0;max-width:550px;border-top:1px solid #dce6ec}.exchange-evidence>*{padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce6ec;font-size:12px}.exchange-evidence span{color:#607a8a}.exchange-offer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 165px;gap:17px;margin-top:31px;padding:20px;background:#eaf3f9;border-left:4px solid var(--et-orange)}.exchange-offer h2{margin:3px 0 8px}.exchange-offer p:not(.kicker){font-size:13px}.exchange-offer-placeholder{display:grid;align-content:center;gap:6px;padding:13px;background:#fff;font-size:12px}.exchange-offer-placeholder span{color:#617989}.exchange-footer{margin-top:30px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #dce6ec;font-size:11px;color:#5d7587}@media(max-width:650px){.exchange-hero,.exchange-fit-grid,.exchange-offer{grid-template-columns:1fr}.exchange-hero{padding:19px 15px}.exchange-deck{font-size:15px}.exchange-process{grid-template-columns:1fr}.exchange-evidence{grid-template-columns:100px 1fr}}
</style>
